B.TM=s(["I act with courage and let my energy lead the way.","I trust the spark in me to find its own direction.","My enthusiasm is a gift I offer without apology."],t.s)
B.S6=s(["I build steadily, trusting that small steps compound.","I am grounded enough to move at my own true pace.","What I tend carefully today will hold tomorrow."],t.s)
B.a4a=s(["I stay open to the idea I have not thought of yet.","My words carry more weight when I choose them with care.","I let curiosity lead me somewhere useful today."],t.s)
B.ZS=s(["I trust what I feel, even before I can explain it.","My sensitivity is information, not a weakness.","I let today's feelings move through me instead of around me."],t.s)
