B.a_E=s(["Write down one intention for the weeks ahead, in a single clear sentence.","Clear one small space \u2014 a drawer, a desk corner \u2014 as a symbolic fresh start."],t.s)
B.Si=s(["Take one concrete first step toward something you named recently.","Say one intention out loud to someone you trust."],t.s)
B.UM=s(["Name the one obstacle in your way, plainly, and decide your next move.","Do the task you have been quietly avoiding, for just ten minutes."],t.s)
B.aat=s(["Refine one piece of work you're proud of \u2014 polish it further, don't start over.","Ask for feedback on something you're close to finishing."],t.s)
B.ag6=s(["Sit quietly for a few minutes and notice what feels complete right now.","Write down what you're genuinely grateful for this month, without editing yourself."],t.s)
B.abe=s(["Share something you've learned recently with someone who'd value it.","Choose one small space or task that has become disordered and give it ten focused minutes."],t.s)
B.W3=s(["Let go of one commitment that no longer serves you \u2014 even a small one.","Forgive yourself, in writing, for one thing you've been carrying."],t.s)
B.YF=s(["Rest without guilt today; let stillness be the whole point.","Review the past month quietly before the new cycle begins."],t.s)
